ers for hide/unhide", "created_at": "2011-10-06T14:47:30Z", "repo": "Glick2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d188f0c2f32aaa9f4fe7e482c91453eb8d02bf2d", "message": "Check the size of the right directory...", "created_at": "2011-10-06T10:50:47Z", "repo": "Glick2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4df3812f3e59213fc2712fbb064d3cf8246efa54", "message": "Better ownership model for inodes\n\nnew_dir doesn't add child, instead we do the mount magic\nin add_child. Also we don't need the ref from known_children > 0", "created_at": "2011-10-06T10:44:15Z", "repo": "Glick2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f6d384fbc60579954d8088774dc6498564f6be78", "message": "Initial move to new in-memory inode setup", "created_at": "2011-10-05T19:58:38Z", "repo": "Glick2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f6465ecd07e83ed6ad9f976e97fd7db91cd8e02d", "message": "Change inotify hack to hide inodes and mknod them", "created_at": "2011-09-29T18:58:53Z", "repo": "Glick2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}